# CDN tree (RESEARCH_PLAN §11/§12). Regenerated by
# `bun run generate` into lib/cdn/{packs,icons-index}/v1/. Tracked as
# a build artifact rather than source: the data is re-derivable from
# the generator + @iconify/json version, and committing 10 MB of JSON
# duplicates what's already in lib/data/{packs,icons_index}.json.
#
# Production deploys flip the build into CDN mode via
# `--dart-define=ICONIFYX_USE_CDN=true` (see lib/bootstrap/cdn_config.dart
# + docs/DEPLOYMENT.md §11/§12). To publish the CDN tree, tag the
# regenerated commit (e.g. `iconify-2.2.500`) on GitHub and push the tag
# — jsDelivr serves it instantly. Override the URL per-build with the
# `ICONIFYX_CDN_BASE_URL` env var when SHA-pinning a release.
/lib/cdn/

